A small request

If this project helped you - you run it on your server, built on it or
just learned something from it - it would be really nice if you mentioned
where it came from. A short "thanks to nairoad" with a link to the
repository is plenty. It is not a condition of the license, just a way for
me to see that the work found its way to people.

The client prints one line to the browser console when it starts:

    Metin2 WebClient by nairoad - https://github.com/nairoad/Metin2-WebClient

You are free to remove it, but I would be glad if you kept it.

Thank you, and have fun.
